### Echo — gibt msg unverändert zurück
GET {{server}}/echo?msg=hello-testing-elevator
Accept: application/json

###

### Echo — Sonderzeichen
GET {{server}}/echo?msg=CCC-Publikum
Accept: application/json

###

### UUID — generiert UUIDv4, persistiert in PostgreSQL
GET {{server}}/uuid
Accept: application/json

###

### Key — RSA 512 Bit (schnell)
GET {{server}}/key?size=512
Accept: application/json

###

### Key — RSA 2048 Bit (merklich langsamer)
GET {{server}}/key?size=2048
Accept: application/json

###

### Key — RSA 4096 Bit (deutlich langsamer)
GET {{server}}/key?size=4096
Accept: application/json

###

### Key — ungültiger Wert → HTTP 400
GET {{server}}/key?size=9999
Accept: application/json

###
